      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Slight increase\" in latency isn't exactly what the Board wanted to hear. Can you dig deeper into those numbers? I need more detail on what specifically causes the latency spike. Is it the communication overhead between the nodes, or is the local decision-making failing on certain complex routes? \n\nAlso, give me a worst-case scenario simulation. What happens to the delivery reliability if we go from 70% reduction to 95% reduction in central authority? I need to see if the Hydra nodes can actually hold the line without the core's oversight.",
